Market position

- One of the three major consumer credit reporting institutions in the world.
- Total income of $5.681 billion in 2024, between the Experian (approximately $7.1 billion) and TransUnion (approximately $4.2 billion)
- The Work Numer database, which has 209 million active records (as of the end of 2025), is the largest global income and employment validation database
- Important share in the United States mortgage credit reporting field

